## Why This Is Asked
Assesses practical, real-time ICA design under nonstationarity: adaptive whitening, dynamic channel handling, and concrete evaluation plans.

## Key Concepts
- Online whitening with forgetting factor
- Per-bin ICA vs joint diagonalization trade-offs
- Scalable demixer for dynamic channels
- Cross-bin permutation alignment via envelopes and energy cues
- Ground-truth evaluation and strict latency targets

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code illustrating the update loop
let W = initWhitening();
while (streaming) {
  const X = readFrame();
  const Xw = applyWhitening(X, W);
  const S = (independenceStable(Xw) ? perBinICA(Xw) : jointDiag(Xw));
  updateDemixer(S);
  if (dropoutDetected) reinitDemixer();
}
```

